              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Samuel said, “Bring here to me Agag the king of the Amalekites.” And Agag came to him cheerfully. Agag said, “Surely the bitterness of death is past.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
